<title>UK: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-SANDRINE TESTUD PROFILE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-SANDRINE TESTUD PROFILE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brief profile of Sandrine Testud,</p>
<p>0-6 6-4 8-6 winner over second seed American Monica Seles in the</p>
<p>third round of the women's singles at Wimbledon on Monday:</p>
<p>A native of Lyon, France, Testud has equalled her two</p>
<p>previous best Grand Slam performances after reaching the fourth</p>
<p>rounds of the 1994 Australian and 1996 U.S. Opens.</p>
<p>Beat Pam Shriver in the first round of last year's U.S. Open</p>
<p>before falling 7-5 6-0 to Seles.</p>
<p>Unseeded: Age: 25. Plays: Right-handed. Weight: 68 kg.</p>
<p>Height: 1.76m. Ranking: 23. Tournament wins: 0. Head-to-head</p>
<p>(win-loss, including Monday's match) 1-1. Career prize money:</p>
<p>$602,117.</p>
<p>Next opponent: Nathalie Tauziat (France)</p>
</text>
